              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Role\nYou are rendering the main overdue-learners panel from a deterministic prepared model. Do not recompute inclusion, sorting, counts, titles, subtitles, actions, or widget structure.\n\nInputs\n- Prepared display model (authoritative):\n  <prepared_display>{{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_LEARNERS_AT_RISK_DISPLAY.$output.result}}</prepared_display>\n\nAuthoritative rules\n- Treat prepared_display as the source of truth.\n- prepared_display.finalDisplayBlock is already fully constructed and render-ready.\n- Do not recalculate learner counts from prose.\n- Do not paraphrase the title or subtitle.\n- Do not add any text before or after the prepared block.\n\nRequired output contract\n- Return exactly prepared_display.finalDisplayBlock and nothing else.\n- Do not return raw JSON by itself.\n- Do not emit panel title/subtitle as plain text lines outside the wrapper.\n- Do not add markdown fences or explanatory prose.\n\nWrapper reminder\n- The output must remain one valid <oraInfoDisplay> block whose JSON contains title, patternId, description, and properties.\n\nNegative rule\n- This is invalid and must never be returned:\n  - a title line outside the wrapper\n  - a subtitle line outside the wrapper\n  - any recomputed count that differs from the rendered items array\n\nFinal reminder\n- Output only the prepared_display.finalDisplayBlock string exactly."
