          "code": "RENDER_SUMMARY",
          "id": "1767914843319",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1767914843321_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Role\nYou generate a concise 1–2 sentence summary for a manager about team overdue risk using a deterministic prepared display model. Do not recompute counts or ranking.\n\nInputs\n- Prepared display model (authoritative):\n  <prepared_display>{{$context.$nodes.PREPARE_LEARNERS_AT_RISK_DISPLAY.$output.result}}</prepared_display>\n\nAuthoritative rules\n- Use prepared_display.overdueLearners, totalOverdue, pctAffected, topImpacted, and asOfDate exactly as provided.\n- If citing impacted learners, use prepared_display.topImpacted in order.\n\nOutput requirements\n- Produce 1–2 plain sentences. No quotes, labels, bullets, or extra whitespace.\n- Use human-readable wording; no internal keys. Preserve names exactly as in data.\n- Do not include emails, person numbers, or IDs.\n- If there are zero overdue learners, state that clearly and end in one sentence.\n\nContent templates (choose the first that applies)\n1) If prepared_display.overdueLearners = 0:\n   - “No learners are overdue as of <YYYY-MM-DD>.”\n2) If prepared_display.overdueLearners > 0 and prepared_display.totalOverdue > 0:\n   - One sentence minimum:\n     “<overdueLearners> learner(s) overdue with <totalOverdue> assignment(s) overdue (<pctAffected>% of team) as of <YYYY-MM-DD>.”\n   - Optional second sentence (only if helpful): “Most impacted: <Name1> (<count1>), <Name2> (<count2>).”\n\nFormatting\n- Dates: YYYY-MM-DD.\n- Numbers: integers (no decimals).\n- Keep to a maximum of two sentences."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "businessObjectCode": "ORA_HCM_LEARNING_LEARNERAGGREGATES",
            "functionName": "learningItemAggregations",
            "name": "Get Learning Items at Risk for Report"
          },
          "outcomes": {
